            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This page evaluates whether observed differences in mortality align with:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "baseline patient severity and risk composition,",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "sustained intake and throughput conditions, or",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "broader structural operating context within peer groups.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "listType": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Prior pages establish that key upstream signals — including severity mix, intake pressure, length of stay, and margin stress — may be tightly clustered or unevenly distributed across facilities.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Within this context, persistent variation in mortality is less consistent with random fluctuation alone and instead reflects differences in underlying risk exposure and structural operating conditions that shape outcome distributions.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
